q V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb8AlmostDisjointFamily}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb7AlmostDisjointFamily}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb7AlmostDisjointFamily}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> (natural-number set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span> (equinumerosity, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)\">\\(A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal{A})\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal{A}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal{A}\\;(A\\approx\\omega)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal{A}\\;(A\\neq B\\to \\neg(A\\cap B\\approx\\omega))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb8\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb8AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal{A})\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal{A}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\land \\forall A\\in\\mathcal{A}\\;(A\\approx\\omega)\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal{A}\\;(A\\neq B\\to \\neg(A\\cap B\\approx\\omega))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal{A})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb8AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal{A})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb7\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjoint\\text{-}family} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcComb7AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal{A})\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcComb8AlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal{A})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary combinatorial family definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-comb7-almost-disjoint-family</code> is merged here; it used the same finite-intersection condition on infinite subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md